# PQ-010: Acid can selectively remove carbonate from a silver precipitate mixture
# Design only: predictions below are not measured observations.
register lv3
add v1 water 100mL
add v1 NaCl 0.0003mol
add v1 Na2CO3 0.0002mol
add v1 AgNO3 0.0007mol
inspect v1
add v1 CH3COOH 0.001mol
inspect v1
inspect
